  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place carrot & zucchini mix and capsicum on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• When roast veggies have 10 minutes remaining, roughly chop brown onion.\n• Cut bake-at-home ciabatta into slices. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a small bowl, combine garlic paste and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2d1c5dd7d57f2ca82c091-27011abc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and lentils and cook, until fragrant and slightly tender, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2d1c5dd7d57f2ca82c091-e44c38ef.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, brush garlic oil over ciabatta slices.\n• Place ciabatta directly on wire racks in the oven and bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• To saucepan with lentils, stir in passata, the water, the brown sugar and vegetable stock powder. Simmer until slightly reduced, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, and add roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves, stirring until combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2d1c5dd7d57f2ca82c091-682afbfe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide herby tomato lentil and roast veggie stew between bowls.\n• Top with plant-based basil pesto. Serve with garlic dippers. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2d1c5dd7d57f2ca82c091-97ad1a20.jpeg"
    }
  ]
